# Your personal overrides — intentionally untracked.
#   local-options.conf   your @cfg_* values, read BEFORE the modules
#   local.conf           raw tmux commands, read LAST
# See docs/configuration/local-overrides.md for why there are two.
local-options.conf
local.conf
config/themes/custom.conf

# Docs build output
site/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Backups made by install.sh
*.bak-*

# NOTE: vendor/ and plugins/ are deliberately NOT ignored.
#   vendor/   holds the vendored plugin subtrees — the whole point is that they
#             ship inside the repository so nothing is downloaded at startup.
#   plugins/  holds our adapter .conf files, which are project source.
